---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<section class="about-section">
		<h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
		<p>
			Hi, I'm Bill and I like to make food. I cook about 95% of my meals at home.
		</p>
		<p>
			Over the years, I've gradually developed a lifestyle I call "cooking by default". This is a sort of habitual, systematic approach to home cooking.
			I've thought through and streamlined the cooking process end to end in a way that makes it approachable, balanced, and enjoyable.
		</p>
		<p>
			This blog is where I write about what actually moves the needle. Techniques, economics of the kitchen, how to navigate gaps, ingredients I like.
			And a few recipes here and there as well. 
		</p>
		<p>
			Maybe you'll find it helpful, even if you don't (yet) love to cook.
		</p>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about-section {
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		padding: 0 var(--space-xl);
	}
	.page-title {
		font-size: var(--font-size-h2);
		text-align: center;
	}
</style>
